<title>USA: New Orleans, La. $4.5 mln won by Merrill. [CORRECTED 20:46 GMT]</title>
<headline>New Orleans, La. $4.5 mln won by Merrill. [CORRECTED 20:46 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co (corrects from A.G. Edwards) said it won $4.5 million of  New Orleans, La., Audubon Commission improvement and refunding general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.4220 percent (corrects from 5.52 percent).</p>
</text>
